OL,3,GNEWSACamden Council at 'sharp end of
OL,4,Athe housing crisis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe changes come as businesses and
OL,7,Fresidents affected by regeneration
OL,8,Fprojects describe financial hardship,
OL,9,Fdisplacement and a growing sense that
OL,10,Fthe planning system is failing local
OL,11,Fcommunities.
